<PARA INFOID = "T010039A135" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "20Sep2003"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Accessory Layout</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A serpentine belt drive system, in which all accessories are driven by 1 V-ribbed belt, has been adopted, reducing overall engine length and weight. An automatic tensioner for the V-ribbed belt has been adopted, extending the life of the belt and accessories, making them maintenance-free and improving serviceability when removing and installing the belt.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>By lowering the tension of the accessory drive belt, friction has been reduced and fuel economy improved.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
